    42→/**
    43→ * Parse "Load These Files" section from a startup prompt.
    44→ * Returns an array of { path, purpose } entries.
    45→ *
    46→ * Recognises bullet-list items of the form:
    47→ *   - `path/to/file.md` — purpose description
    48→ *   - `path/to/file.md` (purpose description)
    49→ *   - `path/to/file.md`
